{"unit_id":"lizhecome__deepseek-harness-tool-palette#card-zh","repo":"lizhecome/deepseek-harness-tool-palette","commit":"2278e765cd5f51d088b95a9b6cb91ab78d5b5473","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness Tool Palette 是一款面向 DSH Agent 的工具发现插件。它注册常驻的 tool_search 工具，并为每个 Agent 设置独立的工具可见列表；模型可按能力、名称或参数搜索已安装的全局工具，预览匹配结果，或解锁最多指定数量的工具供后续步骤使用。搜索按名称、描述和参数文本进行确定性排序，也能为子 Agent 将解锁权限沿运行时所有者链传递。配置可指定始终可见的工具、结果数、查询长度和描述长度上限。适合安装了许多工具、希望按需呈现能力的 DSH 部署；不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:196-215","src/index.ts:258-300"]}
{"unit_id":"lizhecome__deepseek-harness-tool-palette#card-en","repo":"lizhecome/deepseek-harness-tool-palette","commit":"2278e765cd5f51d088b95a9b6cb91ab78d5b5473","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DeepSeek Harness Tool Palette lets DSH Agents search global tools by capability, name, or parameter, then preview or unlock matches. Results are deterministic and visibility is per Agent, including child Agents. Configure baseline tools and search limits. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:196-215","src/index.ts:258-300"]}
