{"unit_id":"lizhecome__deepseek-harness-tool-palette#feature-1","repo":"lizhecome/deepseek-harness-tool-palette","commit":"2278e765cd5f51d088b95a9b6cb91ab78d5b5473","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness Tool Palette 的功能「按需搜索工具」：模型调用 tool_search，以能力、工具名或参数文本查询全局已安装工具，获得按相关度排序的有限匹配及描述。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:202-215","src/index.ts:271-276","src/index.ts:294-300"]}
{"unit_id":"lizhecome__deepseek-harness-tool-palette#feature-2","repo":"lizhecome/deepseek-harness-tool-palette","commit":"2278e765cd5f51d088b95a9b6cb91ab78d5b5473","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness Tool Palette 的功能「预览或解锁匹配工具」：搜索参数 unlock=false 时只返回结果；默认开启解锁，将隐藏的匹配工具加入 Agent 后续步骤可见的工具集合。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:211-214","src/index.ts:277-287"]}
{"unit_id":"lizhecome__deepseek-harness-tool-palette#feature-3","repo":"lizhecome/deepseek-harness-tool-palette","commit":"2278e765cd5f51d088b95a9b6cb91ab78d5b5473","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness Tool Palette 的功能「按 Agent 隔离工具」：插件为每个运行中的 Agent 设置可撤销的工具可见限制；子 Agent 解锁时沿所有者链放开所需工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:158-188","src/index.ts:145-155","src/index.ts:282-287"]}
